  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="label">03</span>
    The Broken Road — Chabahar and the INSTC Crisis
  </div>

  <!-- TIMELINE -->
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="timeline-title">India–Kazakhstan Uranium Diplomacy — Key Milestones</div>
    <div class="tl-row">
