    </div>
    <div class="tl-row">
      <div class="tl-year">Feb 2026</div>
      <div class="tl-event"><strong>Iran Crisis</strong>Assassination of Supreme Leader Khamenei; full-scale US-Israel-Iran conflict begins. INSTC environment deteriorates sharply.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-row">
      <div class="tl-year">Apr 2026</div>
      <div class="tl-event"><strong>$4B Uranium Contract</strong>Kazatomprom EGM votes 92.9% in favour of DAE supply deal. PFBR Kalpakkam achieves first criticality.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-row">
      <div class="tl-year">Apr 26, 2026</div>
      <div class="tl-event"><strong>US Sanctions Waiver Expires</strong>No extension granted. Chabahar terminal operations effectively suspended. Union Budget 2026-27 allocates zero rupees to the project.</div>
    </div>
